n"} {"question" "q-41944" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} \\\\ -3 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978659/state.json" "file_sha256" "5d202b35250385a2fb2656559dcf5f4a0b5ce8cd4ea309239a368884332ab69c" "basis" 840 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978659/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-41944" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2\\sqrt{2} & -3.2\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978659/state.json" "file_sha256" "5d202b35250385a2fb2656559dcf5f4a0b5ce8cd4ea309239a368884332ab69c" "basis" 840 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13978659/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-141281" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+\\frac{2\\pi }{3})=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035241/state.json" "file_sha256" "36a375ee6ee6aed3cd4a02d9a41385a1beb1356ae26e4b0633f09eef4476b2e5" "basis" 1237 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035241/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-141281" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Recall the sum formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(u+v)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v+\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the sum formula for sine with $u=x$ and $v=\\frac{2\\pi }{3},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+\\frac{2\\pi }{3}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{3})+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2})+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot (\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035241/state.json" "file_sha256" "36a375ee6ee6aed3cd4a02d9a41385a1beb1356ae26e4b0633f09eef4476b2e5" "basis" 1237 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035241/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-141281" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035241/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "d8e941685c2fbed9e57620ad4338bcc7ffd9b578b42c995784607c9dcd16532a" "basis" 1237 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035241/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-141281" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035241/state.json" "file_sha256" "36a375ee6ee6aed3cd4a02d9a41385a1beb1356ae26e4b0633f09eef4476b2e5" "basis" 1237 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035241/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-141281" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14035241/st